      ],
      "context_support_ratio": 1.0,
      "failure_surface": "synthesis_gap",
      "stage_loss_tokens": {
        "bonogo": "evidence_gap",
        "caelynn": "evidence_gap",
        "thalia": "hit",
        "wolf": "hit",
        "guards": "hit",
        "ephanna": "evidence_gap"
      },
      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: The Session 12 council chamber fight includes the Players, the Wolf, Thalia, and multiple Guards (including elite and corrupted ones); council members are not explicitly confirmed present in the fight.\n\n**Who\u2019s in the chamber (grounded):**\n- **Players (group)** \u2014 actively engaged in the battle and influencing events in the chamber (OBSERVED).\n- **The Wolf** \u2014 central adversary in the council chamber battle (CANON + OBSERVED).\n- **Thalia (Commander of the Guard)** \u2014 present with the Wolf (\u201cWolf is standing at Thalia\u2019s shoulder\u201d) and participates in combat (OBSERVED).\n- **Guards** \u2014 multiple present, including **8 regular guards and 2 elite guards**, some corrupted; reinforcements are also being drawn into the chamber (OBSERVED + CANON).\n\n**Not confirmed:**\n- **Council members** \u2014 while the Players recount their story to the council (OBSERVED), the projection does not explicitly confirm council members are present during the fight itself.\n\n---\n\nKey Attributes:\n- **Combatants:** Players, the Wolf, Thalia, Guards  \n- **Reinforcements:** Guards being drawn to chamber  \n- **Environment:** trapped, warded, illusion-filled council room  \n- **Faction tension:** Wolf (cultist) vs city defenders (fractured by corruption)",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
    {
