        "cult": "hit"
      },
      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: The Shepherds (the Shepherd\u2019s Flock) are a cult-like group actively recruiting and protesting, and they answer to **Maelthor**, whose influence they serve and promote.\n\nThe **Shepherd\u2019s Flock** are a cult organization operating openly (e.g., protests at the gates) while secretly advancing a darker agenda. They recruit vulnerable or \u201ctransformed\u201d individuals and frame their actions as necessary sacrifices for a greater good. Publicly, they present themselves as defenders of human settlements, masking their true purpose.\n\nThey are explicitly **followers of Maelthor** (OBSERVED faction) and are aligned with **Maelthor\u2019s influence and emergence** (OBSERVED loyalty). Their doctrine includes cleansing the world of \u201cimpurities\u201d and promoting human supremacy (CANON goals), indicating a zealous, possibly extremist belief system tied to this power.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Faction: Followers of **Maelthor**\n- Role: Cultists staging protests and recruiting\n- Goals: \u201cCleansing\u201d the world, human supremacy, expanding ranks\n- Activity: Actively recruiting transformed individuals, hiding corruption (e.g., corrupted meat)\n- Public Face: Defensive, protective rhetoric masking true intent",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
