      "answer": "TL;DR: Torrin represents the Guilds (Master Smith), Rurik represents infrastructure (Chief Architect), and Merril\u2019s council role is not defined in the provided context.\n\nTorrin Flamescale  \n- Job: Master Smith; Representative of the Guilds (OBSERVED)  \n- Role on council: Speaks for craft guilds and industry interests.\n\nRurik Stonehammer  \n- Job: Chief Architect (OBSERVED)  \n- Role on council: Representative of Infrastructure (CANON); responsible for the city's structural integrity and defenses.\n\nMerril  \n- No role or job is provided in the projection context. Cannot determine from available facts.\n\nKey Attributes  \n- Governance: Council includes faction representatives like Guilds (Torrin) and Infrastructure (Rurik).  \n- City concerns: Structural integrity and defenses (Rurik), economic/craft interests (Torrin).",
      "embedding_similarity": null
