      "answer": "TL;DR: The Council Chambers were heavily disrupted\u2014blasted by a Fireball, left disheveled, and had their magical defenses (runes and illusory walls) actively triggered during the fight.\n\nDuring Session 12 (OBSERVED), the room saw several impactful changes:\n- A Fireball lit up almost the entire room, implying significant blast damage and visual chaos.\n- The chamber\u2019s physical state is explicitly noted as disheveled.\n- Magical defenses activated: runes along the walls triggered when Caelynn cast her spell.\n- Illusory walls were present and actively affecting the battlefield.\n- The space functionally shifted from a formal meeting hall into a combat environment, with guards being drawn in as reinforcements.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Geography: Large circular room, central table, high ceilings, hidden trapdoor\n- Defenses: Activated runes, illusory walls, ancient wards\n- Physical Condition: Disheveled\n- Atmosphere: Fireball-lit, chaotic, no longer orderly or ceremonial",
